            </note>
            <note corresp="#d688-f3" n="55" xml:id="d688-f3-content">
                <p>President of China, 1923–24. For correspondence concerning the “resignation” of
                    President Tsao in 1926, see <ref target="frus1926v01#pg_609"><hi
